# Build context is the REPO ROOT (docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile .). Only
# packages/ml-video, packages/llm-client and apps/api are COPYed into the image;
# the `**/`-prefixed rules below keep secrets, virtualenvs, caches and tests OUT of
# those copied trees, and the plain rules trim the context sent to the daemon.

# --- Secrets: NEVER bake env files into the image (Principle IX; runtime env only) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- Python virtualenvs (Windows-built here; useless + huge in a linux image) ---
**/.venv
**/venv

# --- Python caches / coverage / build cruft ---
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov
**/*.egg-info
**/.python-version

# --- Tests (not needed at runtime) ---
**/tests

# --- The web app + Node toolchain (not part of this image) ---
apps/web
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/build

# --- Docs, specs, thesis, mocks, scratch ---
docs
specs
.specify
.agents
.claude
scripts
supabase
_scratch-*
*.html

# --- Smoke / validation / keep-up scratch harnesses ---
.smoke_*
.validation_*
.azure_keepup_*

# --- VCS / CI / editor / OS ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
